  "statement": "For \\(n\\) an integer, evaluate\n\n\\[\\lim _{n \\rightarrow \\infty}\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n^{2}-0^{2}}}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n^{2}-1^{2}}}+\\cdots+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n^{2}-(n-1)^{2}}}\\right)\\]",
